drawio (vendored)

This directory contains vendored copies of artifacts from the draw.io
project (https://github.com/jgraph/drawio).

  Source:   https://github.com/jgraph/drawio
  Vendored: 2026-05-08
  License:  Apache License 2.0
            https://github.com/jgraph/drawio/blob/dev/LICENSE

Two vendored bundles:

  ./viewer-static.min.js
    Read-only viewer (~3.7 MB). Loaded on demand by DrawioView.tsx and
    served at /widget/vendor/drawio/viewer-static.min.js. Used for the
    streamed-diagram view-only mode (gui-drawio M1).

  ./editor/  (gitignored — ~50 MB)
    Full drawio editor webapp, minimum subset for embed mode. Loaded
    by DrawioEditor.tsx via an iframe pointing at
    /widget/vendor/drawio/editor/index.html?embed=1&proto=json&...
    Used by gui-drawio-editor (B-Heavy) for in-place editing after the
    diagram has finished streaming.

    The editor bundle is NOT committed to git (would bloat history with
    thousands of small static assets). Re-vendor on a fresh clone via:

        cd app/ktw-display/vendor/drawio
        ./setup-editor.sh        # bash / WSL / git-bash
        ./setup-editor.ps1       # PowerShell

    Both scripts do a sparse, depth-1 clone of jgraph/drawio and copy
    the minimum subset required for embed mode.

Upgrades: refetch from the source URL above and update the "Vendored"
date. Files are copied byte-identical from upstream — no transformation
applied.
